---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Claudia Leit — The Makers Collective | Waiheke Island Art"
  description="Claudia Leit is a watercolourist with The Makers Collective, working from Waiheke Island, New Zealand."
>
  <section class="wrap artist">
    <h1>Claudia Leit</h1>
    <p>
      Claudia Leit paints small. Most of her watercolours are no larger
      than a sheet of paper held in one hand, close studies of a single
      flower, shell, or piece of driftwood found on her morning walk. She
      works quickly and wet-on-wet, often finishing a piece in under twenty
      minutes, then spends far longer deciding whether it's actually
      finished at all.
    </p>
    <p>
      Originally from Berlin, Claudia came to Waiheke on a residency in
      2017 and never fully left, splitting her year since between the
      island and short stretches back in Europe. Her practice is
      deliberately modest in scale and material — she uses a single travel
      palette and a handful of brushes she's owned for over a decade —
      which she says keeps her honest: "there's nowhere to hide a bad
      decision in a small painting."
    </p>
    <p>
      Claudia's pieces are rarely planned in advance; she works from
      whatever she's collected that day, which means her body of work reads
      like a quiet, ongoing diary of the island's smaller details rather
      than its coastline or its light. She shows infrequently, preferring
      to sell directly through the collective, and keeps a running,
      handwritten list of every piece she's ever completed, numbered rather
      than titled.
    </p>
    <a href="/gallery" class="btn">View available work</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .artist { padding: 4rem 0 5rem; max-width: 58ch; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .artist h1 { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .artist p { text-align: left; }
  .artist .btn { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
